127046.118600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0X3y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"485a3f6c-4fad-40be-ab4f-241b663b30dd","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`ddc_vim@v0.0.7/types.ts` が `Denops` をエクスポートしてないって起こってますね","ts":"1628125136.117700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OK9T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9abee7dc-34a4-45a1-ab69-f199279c82eb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"報告しました。ただ、なんか自分のconfigだと動作するなぁ","ts":"1628125025.117200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vcU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7bcaa45-0a4f-4d6c-b646-bf0f0132cf07","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/88|https://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/88\u003e","ts":"1628125005.116400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"1824x787px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/issues/88|#88 Deno freeze using denops.vim\u003e","text":"Denops.vim does not work when I start/restart Vim or neovim repeatedly.  \nAnd deno CPU usage is very high.\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/128273763-850f4433-59c2-4565-b02e-c872b04728ee.png|スクリーンショット_2021-08-05_09-46-01\u003e\n\nMinimal vimrc\n\n```\nif \u0026amp;compatible\n  set nocompatible\nendif\n\nset runtimepath^=~/work/ddc.vim\nset runtimepath^=~/work/ddc-around\nset runtimepath^=~/work/ddc-matcher_head\nset runtimepath^=~/work/ddc-sorter_rank\nset runtimepath+=~/src/denops.vim\n\nfiletype plugin indent on\nsyntax enable\n\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', ['around'])\n\"call ddc#custom#patch_global('completionMode', 'inline')\n\"call ddc#custom#patch_global('completionMode', 'manual')\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sourceOptions', {\n      \\ '_': {\n      \\   'ignoreCase': v:true,\n      \\   'matchers': ['matcher_head'],\n      \\   'sorters': ['sorter_rank'],\n      \\ },\n      \\ 'around': {'mark': 'A'},\n      \\ })\ncall ddc#enable()\n```\n\nTo reproduce the problem, you need to start insert mode and input characters repeatedly.","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/41495/128273763-850f4433-59c2-4565-b02e-c872b04728ee.png","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1628124521}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8EGjz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b263085-da30-470e-95f9-769d14488aa3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これです。私の環境でもたまに起こります","ts":"1628117942.116200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc33c63d-281d-4d7b-9af1-236f55709aa1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分の環境で拝んだことがない以上完全に興味本位になるけど、どういう状況で引っかかるのかが気になり太郎","ts":"1628096569.115700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"debdcee2-5016-4dbc-af99-50ee9b2e7029","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば \u003c#CLKR04BEF|plugins\u003e の方でOOMの話がチラッと出てましたが、これです？\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/Oya_M1/status/1422899505158975488\u003e","ts":"1628096543.115000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Oya_M1|@Oya_M1\u003e: たぶんだめだとは思うんだけど\nどこがだめなのかさっきよりもわからん \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E78nglzUYAAm1vS.png\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"みら","author_subname":"@Oya_M1","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Oya_M1/status/1422899505158975488","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1414750540978810898/genM2gLm_normal.jpg","t